Today, I go near Priya's computer.
She is a UI designer in our office.
We work together on the new project.
I say, "Namaste Priya."
Priya says, "Namaste Maya, please sit here."
I ask, "How many years have you done this work?"
Priya says, "I have worked in this field for five years."
She shows her computer to me.
She says, "I have made the new screen pages."
Those interface pages are very beautiful.
Priya explains everything.
I say, "These are very excellent."
Priya says, "Thank you."
"Now you write its code."
"Yes, I have understood the design well," I say.
I return near my computer.
I start writing the code.
